6.3 Implementation details
The diagram below is meant to make the module easier to reason about before reading the target code directly. It is generated from tagged target metadata and the real {targets} dependency graph, then simplified by pruning or bypassing lower-level nodes that would make the view harder to read. It keeps real target names and preserves the dependency structure where practical, while staying compact enough to build intuition about the main control points.





